          - Cost calculation tests
          - Cache hit/miss tests
          - Error handling tests
          - Integration test examples (with real API in staging)
        </content>
      </section>

      <section name="cost_projection" required="true">
        <description>Detailed cost analysis</description>
        <content>
          - Cost per request calculation
          - Monthly cost projection (1000 users scenario)
          - Cache savings calculation
          - Cost breakdown by operation type
          - Optimization recommendations
          - Monitoring and alerting setup
        </content>
        <format>
          Include tables with:
          - Operation | Frequency | Cost per | Monthly Cost
